**VERDICT.**  Form-preservation is GENUINELY PROVABLE at strong coupling — the induced
(multi-plaquette / higher-rep) couplings are connected Ursell contributions suppressed by
the polymer activity `2·w³`, bounded by the summable model defect.  It is PROVABLY NOT
gated by the character/cluster expansion at weak coupling (`w_k → 1`, the
continuum-relevant deep-UV regime), where the activity exceeds `1` and the expansion
