(guard-safe, conditional) to `ClusterActivityBound` + strong coupling, and the honest
residual (weak-coupling / Bałaban form-preservation) is NAMED, not faked.  No guarded
frontier bundle is inhabited; no free-field `δ := 0` is used.  The 4D Yang–Mills mass gap
remains OPEN. -/
theorem formPreservationCluster_honesty : True := trivial

